WEBVTT

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:01.886
<b>I’m working.</b>

00:00:04.941 --> 00:00:06.261
<b>I’m not working.</b>

00:00:09.295 --> 00:00:11.052
<b>You’re sitting</b> in my chair.

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.856
<b>You aren’t sitting</b> in my chair.

00:00:18.894 --> 00:00:20.463
<b>He’s playing</b> football.

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:25.378
<b>He isn’t playing</b> football.

00:00:28.415 --> 00:00:29.885
<b>She’s having</b> a shower.

00:00:32.905 --> 00:00:34.546
<b>She isn’t having</b> a shower.

00:00:37.614 --> 00:00:38.732
<b>It’s raining.</b>

00:00:41.771 --> 00:00:43.121
<b>It isn’t raining.</b>

00:00:46.158 --> 00:00:47.282
<b>We’re having</b> dinner.

00:00:50.331 --> 00:00:51.732
<b>We aren’t having</b> dinner.

00:00:54.802 --> 00:00:56.802
<b>They’re listening</b> to the teacher.

00:00:59.816 --> 00:01:02.013
<b>They aren’t listening</b> to the teacher.

00:01:05.061 --> 00:01:06.321
<b>Are you working</b> now?

00:01:09.399 --> 00:01:10.507
Yes, <b>I am</b>.

00:01:13.591 --> 00:01:14.912
No, <b>I’m not</b>.

00:01:17.943 --> 00:01:19.630
<b>Is she having</b> a shower?

00:01:22.702 --> 00:01:23.892
Yes, <b>she is</b>.

00:01:26.939 --> 00:01:28.177
No, <b>she isn’t</b>.

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:32.894
<b>Are they listening</b> to the teacher?

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:37.294
Yes, <b>they are</b>.

00:01:40.327 --> 00:01:41.841
No, <b>they aren’t</b>.

00:01:44.858 --> 00:01:46.100
<b>Where are you going?</b>

00:01:49.154 --> 00:01:50.167
To a party.

00:01:53.195 --> 00:01:54.255
<b>What's he doing?</b>

00:01:57.319 --> 00:01:59.475
<b>He’s watching</b> TV at home.